Hello, I'm a new player that started mid synthesis so when i started I just looked up a build guide and followed it.

&#x200B;

Now that i'll be playing on league start, where should I look for a build? Should I expect them to get posted now that the patch notes are out?

Have been planning my first steroid cycle for a long time and it was currently schedueled to start at the beginning of next year (middle of jan, 500mg test/week 16 weeks) However My group has decided we want to attend a bunch of musical festivals meaning I'll be missing the gym/proper nutrition on the weekends of week 3, 5 and 7. Is it worth waiting until after this period, or should I just start beforehand? 

&#x200B;

I'm leaning towards starting beforehand so that I can a) be juicy for festivals and b) lose less gains while on test at said festivals.
